\subtree{\title{1. Warm wall clock, 8 workers, load pipelined (s)}
\p{The target metric (OWNER-NOTES 12). \strong{Median of the later passes} (best later pass) of one process that checks the export N times; every pass is a complete run (load pipelined with checking). Later passes = passes 4..N of a process with 8 or more passes (a JVM is still compiling in passes 2 and 3), passes 2..N otherwise; the provenance lists every pass. gruszka and nano-lean: the second of two runs with 8 threads (no JIT: their run is their steady state).}
